.vercel

# Vendored from zxing-wasm by `scripts/copy-zxing-wasm.mjs`, which `dev` and
# `build` both run. A committed copy would be a 1MB binary that has to be
# remembered whenever `barcode-detector` moves, and the wasm is only valid
# against the JS glue it shipped with — so it is generated, never tracked.
public/zxing_reader.wasm
